---
title: 块 IO 路径
type: sequence
tags: [块设备, blk-mq, 调度器, bio]
description: bio 从提交进入 blk-mq 软件队列经调度器到硬件队列执行并完成回调
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Fs as 文件系统层
    participant SubmitBio as submit_bio
    participant Noacct as submit_bio_noacct
    participant BlkMq as blk_mq_submit_bio
    participant Sched as 软件队列与调度器
    participant Hwq as 硬件队列
    participant Dev as 块设备

    Fs->>SubmitBio: 提交 bio 读请求
    SubmitBio->>Noacct: submit_bio_noacct 转换递归为迭代
    Noacct->>BlkMq: blk_mq_submit_bio 进入多队列
    BlkMq->>Sched: rq_qos_throttle 限流与 blk_mq_insert_request 插入
    Sched->>Hwq: blk_mq_run_hw_queue 触发硬件队列派发
    Hwq->>Hwq: blk_mq_dispatch_rq_list 按电梯调度顺序派发
    Hwq->>Dev: 设备执行 IO 请求
    Dev-->>Hwq: 硬件中断通知 IO 完成
    Hwq-->>Sched: blk_mq_complete_request 标记请求完成
    Sched-->>BlkMq: 逐层回传完成
    BlkMq-->>Fs: bio_endio 回调上层结束 IO
